OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of murdering partner
OL,4,Awith broken glass bottles
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who attacked his partner with
OL,7,Fbroken glass bottles has been found
OL,8,Fguilty of murder.
OL,10,FAlexander Brennan, 54, killed Brodie
OL,11,FMacGregor, 23, at her flat in Glasgow's
OL,12,FSpringburn on 26 August 2024.
OL,14,FA post-mortem examination found
OL,15,FMacGregor suffered a total of 78
OL,16,Finjuries to her head and body after she
OL,17,Fwas repeatedly struck with glass
OL,18,Fbottles.
OL,20,FBrennan was convicted and jailed for a
OL,21,Fminimum of 22 years following a trial
OL,22,Fat the High Court in Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
